      <tr><td><strong>Notion</strong></td><td>Web, Windows, Mac, iPhone, Android</td><td>Pages, databases and templates; Plus plan free with a school email</td><td>You build everything yourself; ongoing AI is not in the free student plan</td><td>Paid plans</td></tr>
